<UserControl x:Class="RavensPort.App.Views.CredentialsView"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
             xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
             xmlns:helpers="clr-namespace:RavensPort.App.Helpers"
             xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=mscorlib"
             mc:Ignorable="d" d:DesignWidth="720"
             Background="{StaticResource BgBrush}">
    <UserControl.Resources>
        <sys:String x:Key="KindHelpText">What kind of secret this credential holds.

OAuth2   — a grant authorized in your browser, refreshed automatically before it expires.
API key  — a static key you paste in. No authorization flow, no expiry, nothing to refresh.

Use API key for the many services that never offered OAuth at all. Both kinds attach to routes the same way.</sys:String>

        <sys:String x:Key="DefaultPlacementHelpText">Where this credential's secret goes by default.

Used for two things: it is what the Test button sends, and it prefills the entry when you attach this credential to a route. A route can still override it.

OAuth2 tokens normally want   Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;
API keys normally want        X-Api-Key: &lt;key&gt;   or   ?api_key=&lt;key&gt;</sys:String>

        <sys:String x:Key="TestEndpointHelpText">Optional. A URL that answers 200 to an authenticated GET.

Click Test to send one GET there with this credential attached and see what comes back. Only 200 counts as a pass: redirects are not followed, because following one would report a sign-in page as success.

Nothing else verifies a static API key — without this, the first sign of a typo is a 401 on a real request hours later.

Must be https (plain http is allowed only for localhost) — the secret is sent there.</sys:String>
    </UserControl.Resources>

    <Grid>
        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

        <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="0" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled"
                      helpers:SmoothScroll.Enable="True" Padding="0,0,4,0">
            <StackPanel Margin="16">
            <TextBlock Text="Saved credentials" Style="{StaticResource SectionHeaderStyle}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>

            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource EmptyStateStyle}"
                       Text="No credentials yet — fill in the form below and choose Add credential."
                       Visibility="{Binding HasNoCredentials, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}"/>

            <DataGrid ItemsSource="{Binding Credentials}" AutoGenerateColumns="False" IsReadOnly="True" Margin="0,0,0,12"
                      Visibility="{Binding HasCredentials, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}">
                <DataGrid.Columns>
                    <DataGridTextColumn Header="NAME" Binding="{Binding Name}" Width="130">
                        <DataGridTextColumn.ElementStyle>
                            <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
                                <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
                                <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
                            </Style>
                        </DataGridTextColumn.ElementStyle>
                    </DataGridTextColumn>
                    <DataGridTextColumn Header="KIND" Binding="{Binding KindDisplay}" Width="75">
                        <DataGridTextColumn.ElementStyle>
                            <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
                                <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
                            </Style>
                        </DataGridTextColumn.ElementStyle>
                    </DataGridTextColumn>
                    <!-- Scopes for an OAuth grant; for an API key there are none, so the column
                         carries the more useful fact — where the key goes by default. -->
                    <DataGridTextColumn Header="SCOPES / PLACEMENT" Binding="{Binding ScopesDisplay}" Width="*" MinWidth="160">
                        <DataGridTextColumn.ElementStyle>
                            <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
                                <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
                                <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
                            </Style>
                        </DataGridTextColumn.ElementStyle>
                    </DataGridTextColumn>
                    <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="STATUS" Width="170">
                        <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                            <DataTemplate>
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" Margin="0,0,7,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                             Fill="{Binding StatusKind, Converter={StaticResource CredentialStatusBrushConverter}}"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding StatusDisplay}" TextWrapping="Wrap" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </DataTemplate>
                        </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                    </DataGridTemplateColumn>
                    <DataGridTemplateColumn Header="ACTIONS" Width="330">
                        <DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                            <DataTemplate>
                                <WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,4">
                                    <!-- Connect/Disconnect/Refresh are browser-flow and token
                                         operations. An API key has nothing to authorize and
                                         nothing to refresh, so they are hidden for one. -->
                                    <Button Content="Connect" Margin="2" Style="{StaticResource GhostButtonStyle}"
                                            Visibility="{Binding IsOAuth, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}"
                                            Command="{Binding DataContext.ConnectCommand, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                            CommandParameter="{Binding}"/>
                                    <Button Content="Disconnect" Margin="2" Style="{StaticResource GhostButtonStyle}"
                                            Visibility="{Binding IsConnected, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}"
                                            Command="{Binding DataContext.DisconnectCommand, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                            CommandParameter="{Binding}"/>
                                    <Button Content="Refresh" Margin="2" Style="{StaticResource GhostButtonStyle}"
                                            Visibility="{Binding IsOAuth, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}"
                                            Command="{Binding DataContext.RefreshNowCommand, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                            CommandParameter="{Binding}"/>
                                    <Button Content="Test" Margin="2" Style="{StaticResource GhostButtonStyle}"
                                            Visibility="{Binding CanTest, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}"
                                            ToolTip="{StaticResource TestEndpointHelpText}"
                                            Command="{Binding DataContext.TestCredentialCommand, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                            CommandParameter="{Binding}"/>
                                    <Button Content="Edit" Margin="2" Style="{StaticResource GhostButtonStyle}"
                                            Command="{Binding DataContext.EditCredentialCommand, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                            CommandParameter="{Binding}"/>
                                    <Button Content="Delete" Margin="2" Style="{StaticResource GhostButtonStyle}"
                                            Command="{Binding DataContext.DeleteCredentialCommand, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=UserControl}}"
                                            CommandParameter="{Binding}"/>
                                </WrapPanel>
                            </DataTemplate>
                        </DataGridTemplateColumn.CellTemplate>
                    </DataGridTemplateColumn>
                </DataGrid.Columns>
            </DataGrid>

            <Border Style="{StaticResource SectionCardStyle}" Margin="0,0,0,14">
                <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding FormHeaderText}" Style="{StaticResource SectionHeaderStyle}"/>

                    <!-- The kind is asked first because it decides which of the two blocks
                         below applies; almost nothing is shared between them. -->
                    <UniformGrid Columns="2" Rows="1" Margin="0,0,0,8">
                        <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,0">
                            <TextBlock Text="Credential type" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"
                                       ToolTip="{StaticResource KindHelpText}"/>
                            <ComboBox ItemsSource="{Binding Kinds}" SelectedItem="{Binding SelectedKind}"
                                      ToolTip="{StaticResource KindHelpText}"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <StackPanel Margin="6,0,0,0">
                            <TextBlock Text="Name" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                            <TextBox Text="{Binding NewName, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </UniformGrid>

                    <!-- ============ OAuth2 ============ -->
                    <StackPanel Visibility="{Binding IsOAuthKind, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}">
                        <Border Background="{StaticResource PanelAltBrush}" BorderBrush="{StaticResource BorderBrush0}"
                                BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="4" Padding="10,8" Margin="0,0,0,12">
                            <StackPanel>
                                <TextBlock Text="Redirect URI" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                <TextBox Text="{Binding RedirectUri, Mode=OneWay}" IsReadOnly="True"
                                         FontFamily="Consolas" Foreground="{StaticResource AccentBrush}"
                                         Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" Padding="0"
                                         Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding RedirectUriInfo}" Style="{StaticResource HintTextStyle}"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>

                        <TextBlock Text="Provider preset" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                        <ComboBox ItemsSource="{Binding Presets}" SelectedItem="{Binding SelectedPreset}" Margin="0,0,0,4">
                            <ComboBox.ItemTemplate>
                                <DataTemplate>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}"/>
                                </DataTemplate>
                            </ComboBox.ItemTemplate>
                        </ComboBox>
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding SelectedPreset.HelpText}" Style="{StaticResource HintTextStyle}" Margin="0,0,0,8"/>

                        <UniformGrid Columns="2" Rows="1" Margin="0,0,0,8">
                            <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,0">
                                <TextBlock Text="Client ID" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                <TextBox Text="{Binding NewClientId, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <StackPanel Margin="6,0,0,0">
                                <TextBlock Text="Client secret" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                <PasswordBox x:Name="ClientSecretBox" PasswordChanged="ClientSecretBox_PasswordChanged"/>
                                <TextBlock Text="Leave blank to keep the current secret" Style="{StaticResource HintTextStyle}"
                                           Visibility="{Binding IsEditing, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </UniformGrid>

                        <TextBlock Text="Scopes (comma or space separated)" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                        <TextBox Text="{Binding NewScopes, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" Margin="0,0,0,8"/>

                        <TextBlock Text="Authority (OIDC discovery — leave blank for manual endpoints below)" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                        <TextBox Text="{Binding NewAuthority, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" Margin="0,0,0,8"/>

                        <UniformGrid Columns="2" Rows="1" Margin="0,0,0,10">
                            <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,0">
                                <TextBlock Text="Authorization endpoint" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                <TextBox Text="{Binding NewAuthorizationEndpoint, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                            <StackPanel Margin="6,0,0,0">
                                <TextBlock Text="Token endpoint" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                                <TextBox Text="{Binding NewTokenEndpoint, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </UniformGrid>

                        <!-- Shown only for Google, the one provider whose flow actually reads this
                             flag. IdentityModel.OidcClient (Nextcloud/Custom) always sends a
                             code_challenge and exposes no way to turn it off, so offering the
                             checkbox there advertised a setting that did nothing. -->
                        <StackPanel Visibility="{Binding IsPkceOptionApplicable, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}">
                            <CheckBox Content="Use PKCE" IsChecked="{Binding NewUsesPkce}" Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="Leave on unless your Google client is an older type that rejects PKCE."
                                       Style="{StaticResource HintTextStyle}" Margin="0,0,0,10"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Text="PKCE is always used for this provider — the underlying OAuth library requires it."
                                   Style="{StaticResource HintTextStyle}" Margin="0,0,0,10"
                                   Visibility="{Binding IsPkceAlwaysOn, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}"/>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <!-- ============ API key ============ -->
                    <StackPanel Visibility="{Binding IsApiKeyKind, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}">
                        <TextBlock Text="API key" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                        <PasswordBox x:Name="ApiKeyBox" PasswordChanged="ApiKeyBox_PasswordChanged"/>
                        <TextBlock Text="Stored encrypted and never redisplayed. Leave blank to keep the current key."
                                   Style="{StaticResource HintTextStyle}" Margin="0,3,0,10"/>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <!-- ============ shared by both kinds ============ -->
                    <TextBlock Text="Default placement" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"
                               ToolTip="{StaticResource DefaultPlacementHelpText}"/>
                    <UniformGrid Columns="3" Rows="1" Margin="0,0,0,4">
                        <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,0">
                            <TextBlock Text="Placement" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                            <ComboBox ItemsSource="{Binding Placements}" SelectedItem="{Binding NewDefaultPlacement}"
                                      ToolTip="{StaticResource DefaultPlacementHelpText}"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <StackPanel Margin="6,0">
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding DefaultParameterNameLabel}" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                            <TextBox Text="{Binding NewDefaultParameterName, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <StackPanel Margin="6,0,0,0">
                            <TextBlock Text="Value prefix" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"/>
                            <TextBox Text="{Binding NewDefaultValuePrefix, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </UniformGrid>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HintTextStyle}" Margin="0,0,0,10"
                               Text="{Binding DefaultInjectionSummary, StringFormat='Prefills routes as: {0}. A route can override it.'}"/>

                    <TextBlock Text="Test endpoint (optional)" Style="{StaticResource FieldLabelStyle}"
                               ToolTip="{StaticResource TestEndpointHelpText}"/>
                    <TextBox Text="{Binding NewTestEndpoint, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}"
                             ToolTip="{StaticResource TestEndpointHelpText}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HintTextStyle}" Margin="0,3,0,10"
                               Text="A URL answering 200 to an authenticated GET. Adds a Test button to this credential's row — the only way to check a static API key before a real request fails."/>
                    <TextBlock Text="⚠ Body placement cannot be tested — the test request is a GET, which has no body."
                               Style="{StaticResource HintTextStyle}" Margin="0,0,0,10"
                               Foreground="{StaticResource ErrorBrush}"
                               Visibility="{Binding IsUntestablePlacement, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}"/>

                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <Button Content="{Binding SaveButtonLabel}" Width="140" Command="{Binding SaveCredentialCommand}"/>
                        <Button Content="Cancel" Width="90" Margin="8,0,0,0" Style="{StaticResource GhostButtonStyle}"
                                Command="{Binding CancelEditCommand}"
                                Visibility="{Binding IsEditing, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibilityConverter}}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>

        <!-- Pinned footer: status stays visible instead of scrolling out of view. -->
        <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource FooterBarStyle}">
            <TextBlock Text="{Binding StatusMessage}" Style="{StaticResource FooterTextStyle}"/>
        </Border>
    </Grid>
</UserControl>
